**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/channel_partner/estimate_shipping" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 9e188d66d77f64019a05ae05ac80010039ccbebb1df9b9019a05ae05ac800100" \
  -d $'{
    "channel_partner_order_id": "widget-1245-abc-1",
    "coupons": [
        "10OFF"
    ],
    "items": [
        {
            "merchant_item_id": "shirt",
            "options": [
                {
                    "name": "Size",
                    "value": "Small"
                },
                {
                    "name": "Color",
                    "value": "Orange"
                }
            ],
            "quantity": 1.0,
            "upsell": false
        }
    ],
    "ship_to_residential": true,
    "shipto_address1": "55 Main Street",
    "shipto_address2": "Suite 202",
    "shipto_city": "Duluth",
    "shipto_company": "Widgets Inc",
    "shipto_country_code": "US",
    "shipto_day_phone": "6785552323",
    "shipto_evening_phone": "7703334444",
    "shipto_first_name": "Sally",
    "shipto_last_name": "McGonkyDee",
    "shipto_postal_code": "30097",
    "shipto_state_region": "GA",
    "shipto_title": "Director"
}'
```

**Response Headers**
```html
Status: 200 OK
X-UltraCart-Request-Id: 25250C5EBCDC8C019A0D88C2A580011
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
Transfer-Encoding: chunked
Date: Wed, 22 Oct 2025 20:08:02 GMT
```

